{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pinball Crush",
    "steam_appid": 3683910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Crush is a cozy GBA inspired pinball game with a dating sim progress system. Hit specific targets to access cutscenes and events with your date. There are 300+ unique events to explore, so you'll always have something new!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras/18e7c58802b918d607f9fed44eace6f0.avif?t=1753294766\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a flipper fling - bounce around Cupid's Garden and all the local spots to gain points, upgrade your ball, and find new ways to play.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras/c97ac977b410bb666c8bd77360bc9e59.avif?t=1753294766\" data-has-big width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with and romance up to 6 NPCs on dates to the movies, library, cafe, and more, including collectathons, trivia, and good vibes.\u00a0Even the chipmunks like it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras/55f8e46b55fbdbed2ce511d2485360f0.avif?t=1753294766\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(we spent like two weekends making this chipmunk sized pinball machine. look how cute :3 )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Crush has a blend of original and unedited CC0-CC3 music! If you enjoy the tunes, check out the amazing musicians below!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bus Stop&quot; by Kevin McLeod </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kawai Kitsune&quot; by Holizna Radio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Turkey's Song&quot;, &quot;Shorewood&quot;, and &quot;Chippy Chipmunk&quot; by Joe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sound effects are from the Gamemaster Audio - Pro Sound Collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Crush will run on the Steamdeck, but may require the device to be in controller mode, or in certain cases per-game controller remapping.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Crush is a cozy GBA inspired pinball game with a dating sim progress system. Hit specific targets to access cutscenes and events with your date. There are 300+ unique events to explore, so you'll always have something new!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras/18e7c58802b918d607f9fed44eace6f0.avif?t=1753294766\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a flipper fling - bounce around Cupid's Garden and all the local spots to gain points, upgrade your ball, and find new ways to play.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras/c97ac977b410bb666c8bd77360bc9e59.avif?t=1753294766\" data-has-big width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with and romance up to 6 NPCs on dates to the movies, library, cafe, and more, including collectathons, trivia, and good vibes.\u00a0Even the chipmunks like it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras/55f8e46b55fbdbed2ce511d2485360f0.avif?t=1753294766\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(we spent like two weekends making this chipmunk sized pinball machine. look how cute :3 )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Crush has a blend of original and unedited CC0-CC3 music! If you enjoy the tunes, check out the amazing musicians below!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bus Stop&quot; by Kevin McLeod </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kawai Kitsune&quot; by Holizna Radio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Turkey's Song&quot;, &quot;Shorewood&quot;, and &quot;Chippy Chipmunk&quot; by Joe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sound effects are from the Gamemaster Audio - Pro Sound Collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Crush will run on the Steamdeck, but may require the device to be in controller mode, or in certain cases per-game controller remapping.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Pinball Crush is a pinball dating sim, great for casual gaming and fans of classic pinball alike. Impress your crush and unlock over 300 unique character events on your way to a high score. Pick your favorite date and explore Pinball Crush's bonus stages, each with new mechanics!",
